            "expectedErrorCode": "Unsupported historical surface",
            "failureMechanism": "PageOwnedRevisionRenderer line 45 checks layer.parentGroup || !supported.has(layer.type) and throws 'Unsupported historical surface' because group layout and nested transforms are not yet implemented in the historical viewer adapter."
        }
